<section class="bhd-page__feature">
  <div>
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">The product</p>
    <h2>Hydration powder built around water, electrolytes and glucose</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate is a powdered drink mix intended to be diluted in water. The current label serving is <strong>1 scoop in 500 mL of water</strong>, providing <strong>701 mg sodium</strong>, <strong>388 mg potassium</strong> and a low-sugar glucose-containing electrolyte drink.</p>
    <p>The formula is intentionally compact. Rather than adding a long list of stimulants or unrelated functional ingredients, the current ingredient list focuses on glucose, sodium chloride, citric acid, sodium bicarbonate, potassium chloride and lemon powder.</p>
    <p>For the exact authorized conditions of use, serving instructions, cautions and other label information, the package in hand is the controlling source.</p>
  </div>
